        "title": "Immagini",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>HTML ci permette anche di aggiungere immagini a un HUD di gioco.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   img {&#xA;    border: solid gray 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    width: 260px;&#xA;    margin: auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Level Complete Badge&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;width: 200px;&quot; src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere degli <strong>sprite</strong> all'interfaccia di un gioco, iniziamo con il tag <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Proprio come <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> è un <strong>empty tag</strong>. Significa che non ha un tag di chiusura.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;img&gt;&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;</code>, seguito da <code>img</code> e infine <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per visualizzare uno sprite, un tag immagine ha bisogno dell'attributo <code>src</code>. <code>src</code> sta per origine.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impostiamo lo sprite che vogliamo visualizzare con un segno <code>=</code> e l'indirizzo dell'immagine tra virgolette doppie.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>src</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare gli attributi per modificare le dimensioni degli sprite. Gli attributi <code>width</code> e <code>height</code> usano i pixel come unità di misura predefinita.</p><p>Ad esempio, per impostare la larghezza di questo sprite su 100px, scrivi <code>width = \"100\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;100&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>width</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"100\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>E l'attributo <code>height</code> regola l'<strong>altezza</strong> di uno sprite.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa rende <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> un tag vuoto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non ha alcun tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non ha attributi</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è <code>/</code> nel suo tag di apertura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non ha alcun tag di chiusura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti sprite appariranno su questo HUD di gioco?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 2.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo regolare l'altezza di uno sprite?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Con l'attributo <code>height</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Con il tag <code>&lt;height&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con l'attributo <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale attributo dobbiamo impostare per il tag <code>img</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'attributo <code>src</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'attributo <code>href</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'attributo <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144775,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta l'attributo <code>width</code> dello sprite su <code>\"200\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;width&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>width</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 144776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il tag corretto per un'immagine sprite.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/sword.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;img</code>, seguito da <code>src=</code> e poi <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/sword.png\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 144777,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa l'attributo corretto per impostare la sorgente dello sprite.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
